  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When an image of the entrant reaches the land spirit, Fang Yuan names the threat and recalls that in his previous life the same Gu Master appeared on San Cha Mountain. The land spirit treats extreme light Gu as able to summon the light of glory of the immemorial era. Fang Yuan answers that the Gu was obtained by robbing a tomb and is incomplete, usable only three times each month, and that exceeding that limit makes it self-destruct. On the mountain peak he draws the crowd and forms the killer move Immemorial Light Fist from extreme light Gu, heaven’s will Gu, and empty fist Gu. Righteous path Gu Masters hail him as Lord Xiao Mang.",
      "chapters": [
        389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "move_immemorial_light_fist",
        "gu_heavens_will_gu",
        "gu_empty_fist_gu",
        "sys_righteous_path",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes his appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His body shines with a piercing white light, dense and expanding like a mound. His body is bathed in light, with an impressive appearance like a descending holy spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        393
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "light-bath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While attacking a stone door for King Bao inheritance, he concludes light path lacks the fire-type destructive power the door wants, then abandons that door when a subordinate reports a Gu Immortal treasure in the fog. He scolds the subordinate not to call him second young master, saying he hates that title, and leads his people toward the fog instead.",
      "chapters": [
        392
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "king-bao-door-and-title",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_king_bao_inheritance",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing the dog fog he stores force through purple crystal primeval essence, then fires a light spear into the fog that vaporizes dogs where it lands. Once the fog is gone, the iron bucket defense becomes visible. He then privately agrees with Mo Wu Tian that both sides will attack from front and back in fifteen minutes, and tells the righteous side he rejected demonic cooperation and will strike when the demonic faction draws pressure.",
      "chapters": [
        393
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "front-and-fog",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_wu_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As silver light he appears before Bai Ning Bing and names himself a rank five righteous path expert. Dog emperor Ying Ming blocks him; after fast exchanges he drops his contempt and fights cautiously.",
      "chapters": [
        394
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dog-emperor-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "sys_beast_emperor",
        "char_ying_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Anxious that Tie clan will take the immortal treasure while Ying Ming blocks his path, he flies out through the hole, gathers sunlight into a ball with gather light Gu, then uses extreme light Gu to gather the glory of the immemorial era into that ball until the ball is infected with the glory of the immemorial times, and with river under the sun Gu unleashes the killer move Torrential Light Stream. The light river shatters a purple barrier sustained by Tie clan’s four old-timers and crashes into the bronze hall.",
      "chapters": [
        397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "torrential-light-stream",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "move_torrential_light_stream"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he realizes someone is using his power to refine an Immortal Gu, he stops the killer move at once. He is later stupefied when fixed immortal travel Gu is born anyway.",
      "chapters": [
        405
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-interruption",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Besides Xiao Shan, Xiao Mang is likewise a pawn of Xiao clan’s supreme elder, and the two rank five brothers are played without knowing it.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "supreme-elder-pawns",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_shan",
        "fac_xiao_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan notes that the supreme elder’s high wagers bought two rank five pawns: Xiao Shan enters the contest area first, and Xiao Mang enters later; Xiao Shan belongs to the demonic path and Xiao Mang to the righteous path, so either path’s outcome still feeds that elder’s lead.",
      "chapters": [
        964
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "righteous-path-pawn",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that the light of the immemorial era used in an earlier Fixed Immortal Travel refinement came from extreme light Gu in Xiao Mang’s hands, that Xiao Mang is already dead, that he and Xiao Shan died as pawns of Xiao clan’s supreme elder without learning the mountain’s truth, and that once Xiao Mang died extreme light Gu was destroyed as well.",
      "chapters": [
        1039
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
